00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:46.250
This is season five, episode 24, written by Ryan Coe and directed by Ken Whittingham.
这是第五季第24集，由瑞安·科编剧，肯·威廷汉执导。

356
00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:47.690
